PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Petitioner most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court, in exercise of its inherent jurisdiction under Section 528 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, may graciously be pleased to:

a) Quash and set aside FIR No. {fir_number} dated {fir_date} registered at Police Station {police_station}, District {district}, State of {state}, for offences under {offences_alleged} of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 / {special_acts}, and all consequential proceedings arising therefrom including the chargesheet / cognizance order / pending proceedings in Case No. {case_number_below} pending before the Hon'ble Court of {court_taking_cognizance};

b) Pending hearing and final disposal of this petition, stay further proceedings in the said case before the Court below;

c) Pending hearing and final disposal of this petition, restrain the Respondents from arresting the Petitioner in connection with the said FIR;

d) Award costs of this petition;

e) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner shall ever pray.
